# Verification of Hero Section Modifications

I have modified the Hero section as requested.

## Changes Made
- **Background Image**: Removed the `fixed` attachment to prevent the "jumping" effect on scroll.
- **Blur Effect**: Applied a `blur(8px)` filter to the background image.
- **Text Color**: Changed the "Nuestra Trayectoria" text color to black.

## Verification
- **Visual Check**:
    - The background image should now be blurred.
    - The "Nuestra Trayectoria" text should be black.
- **Scroll Check**:
